2	index 10021cca3..7af2128fb 100644
3	--- a/CHANGELOG.md
4	+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
5	@@ -52,6 +52,12 @@ All notable changes to `entire-brain` are recorded here. The format follows
6	 
7	 ### Fixed
8	 
9	+- A commit in another session no longer fails a history rebuild, such as the one
10	+  in `refresh` or the background history lane, with `memory_source_stale`.
11	+  Finalizing a checkpoint rewrites its transcript on the checkpoint ref, and a
12	+  rebuild read that transcript several times through the moving ref. A rebuild
13	+  now reads one fixed set of blobs, so a finalize that lands mid-rebuild belongs
14	+  to the next one.
15	 - The conversation and history parsers now read the compact transcript
16	   dialect the Entire CLI stores per checkpoint (Entire Transcript Format:
17	   content blocks at the record's top level, no `message` wrapper). A default
